{'symbol': 'AIG', 'date': '2020-12-09 11:00:00', 'title': 'AIG LIFE & RETIREMENT ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP CHANGES', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AIG LIFE & RETIREMENT, A DIVISION OF AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP INC. (NYSE: AIG), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT TODD SOLASH, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF ITS INDIVIDUAL RETIREMENT BUSINESS, WILL TAKE ON AN EXPANDED ROLE WITH THE ADDITIONAL LEADERSHIP OF THE COMPANY'S LIFE INSURANCE BUSINESS, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY. IN HIS NEW ROLE AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, INDIVIDUAL RETIREMENT AND LIFE INSURANCE, MR. SOLASH WILL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR DRIVING THE DIVISION'S STRATEGIC AGENDA"}